Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.09,0:02:55.45,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2000)\c&HF9DFBD&\1a&H37&\t(1300,1300,\c&HDEE6D3&)\t(2540,2540,\c&HF9DFBD&)}縱使心口刺痛 我仍要高聲宣揚
